<h2>Repair now or wait?</h2>
<p>Root intrusion and cracking get worse on a schedule you cannot see. A pipe that can be lined today can become a pipe that must be dug up after one more winter of root growth or one more offset. If the camera shows damage that is still linable, that is the moment the choice is cheapest. If you want to know what a crew would bring to do it, the <a href="/cured-in-place-pipe/equipment">cured in place pipe equipment</a> page is next; if you want to find that crew, start with <a href="/cured-in-place-pipe/near-me">cured in place pipe near me</a>.</p>
